# --- Local AI drafting (preferred) -----------------------------------
# Letter drafting uses a local model served by Ollama when one is running
# (https://ollama.com). No key needed, drafts never leave your device.
# The app auto-detects the best installed model (prefers gemma*).
# Override the server URL or force a specific model here if needed:
#VITE_OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
#VITE_OLLAMA_MODEL=gemma4:e4b

# --- Cloud AI fallback (optional) -------------------------------------
# Used for AI drafting when no local model is available, and for the
# representative-lookup fallback (needs web search, which local models
# don't have). Without a key the app still works — lookup goes directly
# to the Represent API and letters can use the fill-in template mode.
#
# WARNING: a key placed here is bundled into the client-side JavaScript.
# Only use this for personal/local use — never ship a shared key on a
# public website. For a public deployment, proxy the Anthropic call through
# a small server endpoint instead.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
